WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.380 --> 00:00:06.923
Don't worry! Just set me up there!

00:00:14.055 --> 00:00:15.140
Ms. Misato!

00:00:19.561 --> 00:00:20.645
Be careful.

00:00:25.191 --> 00:00:28.236
Wow, that's hot! This doesn't look good.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:29.946
Stop, damn it!

00:00:36.286 --> 00:00:37.620
Ms. Misato, hurry!

00:00:40.248 --> 00:00:41.249
This is it.

00:00:52.761 --> 00:00:54.596
HOPE

00:00:56.431 --> 00:00:58.600
"Error"? What's the deal?

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:07.192
There's no other explanation.
The program's been tampered with!

00:01:13.990 --> 00:01:16.326
Reactor will hit prompt criticality
in zero point two!

00:01:16.951 --> 00:01:18.453
Control rods aren't activating!

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.872
Here goes nothing.

00:01:38.681 --> 00:01:40.183
Ms. Misato! Get out of there!

00:01:40.642 --> 00:01:43.645
Damn it, move! You piece of...

00:01:48.024 --> 00:01:48.900
Ms. Misato!

00:01:54.322 --> 00:01:56.241
Zero point one to prompt criticality!

00:01:56.491 --> 00:01:58.034
It's no use, it's going to blow!

00:01:59.035 --> 00:02:00.495
-We failed...
-Ms. Misato!

00:02:24.018 --> 00:02:24.853
She did it!

00:02:25.186 --> 00:02:27.230
-Pressure down!
-All readings normal!

00:02:27.313 --> 00:02:30.692
-We're saved!
-She did it!

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:32.527
She did it!

00:02:33.319 --> 00:02:34.195
That fool...

00:02:34.863 --> 00:02:36.573
Ms. Misato, are you all right?

00:02:36.781 --> 00:02:37.782
Ms. Misato!

00:02:38.032 --> 00:02:40.869
Yeah, but I feel like crap...

